(7348490, 1148667, 19825, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The density of drops makes me wonder if it is natural or man made rain, but that''s a quibble.<br/> <br/>For future reference, a title would be a plus and, if you find you have entered a challenge without one, you can contact DPC and request they add one during voting.</td>', 'Nicely done. The density of drops makes me wonder if it is natural or man made rain, but that''s a quibble. For future reference, a title would be a plus and, if you find you have entered a challenge without one, you can contact DPC and request they add one during voting.', '2015-05-06 18:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
