(7348564, 1147713, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the tones, the glistening sidewalk and wet bench, the woman and umbrella, the lines of the sidewalk. Really do not like the row of cars across the top.  Nice try at working them in with the title, but I want them gone or as nearly gone as you dare try.  I think I would crop to just above the arrow for here; for elsewhere, I''d get rid of them completely somehow :)</td>', 'Love the tones, the glistening sidewalk and wet bench, the woman and umbrella, the lines of the sidewalk. Really do not like the row of cars across the top.  Nice try at working them in with the title, but I want them gone or as nearly gone as you dare try.  I think I would crop to just above the arrow for here; for elsewhere, I''d get rid of them completely somehow :)', '2015-05-06 23:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7348565, 1148798, 138630, '<td valign="top">Can you sing around a cigarette??</td>', 'Can you sing around a cigarette??', '2015-05-06 23:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
