(7349047, 1147713, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good on topic street shot. No, great on topic street shot. But I hate the funny bars and white line top/bottom borders. Better to ignore them but difficult. If they are to be considered part of the image, I would have to give a 4 because they destroy the spontaneous Cartier-Bresson impact. So I''ll forget the bars and give a 7 for the image itself. Seriously, I have argued with others about this issue and haven''t heard a convincing argument to justify the silly bars - unless you are trying to emulate the sometimes appearance on a TV screen, which is a completely artificial artifact that couldn''d possibly have surfaced without the modern TV experiance.</td>', 'Good on topic street shot. No, great on topic street shot. But I hate the funny bars and white line top/bottom borders. Better to ignore them but difficult. If they are to be considered part of the image, I would have to give a 4 because they destroy the spontaneous Cartier-Bresson impact. So I''ll forget the bars and give a 7 for the image itself. Seriously, I have argued with others about this issue and haven''t heard a convincing argument to justify the silly bars - unless you are trying to emulate the sometimes appearance on a TV screen, which is a completely artificial artifact that couldn''d possibly have surfaced without the modern TV experiance.', '2015-05-08 00:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
